    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The Board is pretty nervous about the Phase II results. Some of the preliminary numbers looked a bit all over the place to me. Are you sure that 85% confidence isn't an overestimation? I need to know if there's any real risk of these projections being wrong before I present this to them.",
